The door of my new flat lies open.
Someone knocks softly on the door.
I go near the door.
Anitha is standing there.
Anitha is my neighbor.
There is a small plant in her hand.
I smile happily looking at her.
"Hello Maya, can I come inside?" Anitha asks.
"Certainly, come inside," I say.
Anitha comes into the living room.
She gives that plant to me.
"This is a gift for the new flat," she says.
"Thank you very much Anitha," I say.
The plant is in a beautiful pot.
Now it is in my hands.
Anitha looks around in the room.
All my things now sit there.
"The room is very beautiful to look at," Anitha says.
"Sit on the sofa," I tell her.
Anitha sits on the sofa.
